flowchart TD
    REQ[Request] --> AUTH{Authenticated?}
    AUTH -- no --> LOGIN[Login Required]
    AUTH -- yes --> RATE{Rate OK?}
    RATE -- no --> THROTTLED[Throttled]
    RATE -- yes --> ROUTER[Request Router]
    ROUTER --> PROFILE[Profile Service]
    ROUTER --> ORDERS[Order Service]
    PROFILE --> CACHE[Redis Cache]
    PROFILE --> USERDB((User DB))
    ORDERS --> QUEUE[Job Queue]
    QUEUE --> WORKER[Worker]
    WORKER --> ORDERDB((Order DB))
    WORKER -.-> METRICS[Metrics]
